name: fastapi-feature
description: Implement or change a FastAPI feature using this project's modular three-layer architecture.
---

# Implement a feature

1. Read `AGENTS.md`, the architecture, conventions and relevant specs or direct
   user requirements. Inspect existing behavior and module patterns.
2. Identify acceptance criteria and consequential missing decisions. Ask the
   user instead of inventing business rules, even if a Mermaid diagram exists.
3. Implement within the established layers and register any new module.
4. Add focused tests for specified behavior and meaningful failures.
5. Run relevant tests and `fastapi-harness check`. Fix failures introduced by
   the change and report results, remaining risks and anything not verified.
